sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Keeper as Warehouse Keeper
    actor Operator as Operator
    actor Retailer as Retailer

    participant UI as FSCM Web Portal / Mobile App

    participant PickAPI as PickingListsController
    participant ShipAPI as ShipmentsController
    participant ComplaintAPI as ComplaintsController

    participant PickSvc as CurrentPickingService
    participant ShipSvc as ShipmentService
    participant ComplaintSvc as ComplaintService
    participant CompletionSvc as OrderCompletionService

    participant PickStore as PickingStore
    participant ShipStore as ShipmentStore
    participant ComplaintStore as ComplaintStore

    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 1 - HANDLE PICKING EXCEPTIONS
    %% ==========================================

    rect rgb(245, 248, 255)

        Note over Keeper,DB: PART 1 - PICKING VALIDATION AND EXCEPTION HANDLING

        Keeper->>+UI: Scan picked goods and verify quantities

        UI->>+PickAPI: Scan(pickingCode, scanRequest)
        PickAPI->>+PickSvc: ScanAsync(pickingCode, data, actorContext)

        %% ------------------------------------------
        %% 1. LOAD PICKING DATA
        %% ------------------------------------------

        PickSvc->>+PickStore: FindAsync(pickingCode)

        PickStore->>+DB: SELECT PickingList and PickingItems
        DB-->>PickStore: Picking data or null
        deactivate DB

        PickStore-->>PickSvc: PickingList context
        deactivate PickStore

        %% ------------------------------------------
        %% 2. VALIDATE SCANNED GOODS
        %% ------------------------------------------

        Note right of PickSvc: Validate Warehouse scope, QR and allocated quantities

        alt Invalid QR, wrong Batch or excessive quantity

            Note right of PickSvc: Reject scan without changing picked quantities

        else Scan is valid

            PickSvc->>+PickStore: FindLabelForUpdateAsync(qrCode)

            PickStore->>+DB: SELECT BatchQrLabel and current status
            DB-->>PickStore: QR Label data
            deactivate DB

            PickStore-->>PickSvc: Label context
            deactivate PickStore

            Note right of PickSvc: Update tracked PickingItem and QR state

            PickSvc->>+PickStore: SaveChangesAsync()

            PickStore->>+DB: UPDATE PickingItem and QR Label state
            Note right of DB: INSERT QR Label event where applicable

            DB-->>PickStore: Picking scan saved
            deactivate DB

            PickStore-->>PickSvc: Save result
            deactivate PickStore

        end

        PickSvc-->>PickAPI: Picking scan result or business error
        deactivate PickSvc

        PickAPI-->>UI: Scan response
        deactivate PickAPI

        UI-->>Keeper: Display scan result
        deactivate UI

        %% ------------------------------------------
        %% 3. COMPLETE PICKING LIST
        %% ------------------------------------------

        Keeper->>+UI: Request PickingList completion

        UI->>+PickAPI: Complete(pickingCode, request)
        PickAPI->>+PickSvc: CompleteAsync(pickingCode, data, actorContext)

        PickSvc->>+PickStore: FindAsync(pickingCode)

        PickStore->>+DB: SELECT PickingList and item completion status
        DB-->>PickStore: Current PickingList data
        deactivate DB

        PickStore-->>PickSvc: Picking context
        deactivate PickStore

        %% ------------------------------------------
        %% 4. CHECK PICKING COMPLETION
        %% ------------------------------------------

        alt Missing quantity, unresolved mismatch or invalid state

            Note right of PickSvc: PickingList cannot be completed

            Note right of PickSvc: Do not create Shipment

            Note right of PickSvc: Preserve allocated stock and Reservations

        else All PickingItems are complete

            %% ------------------------------------------
            %% 5. PREVENT DUPLICATE SHIPMENT
            %% ------------------------------------------

            PickSvc->>+PickStore: ShipmentExistsAsync(orderId, warehouseId)

            PickStore->>+DB: SELECT existing Shipment
            DB-->>PickStore: Existence result
            deactivate DB

            PickStore-->>PickSvc: Exists or NotExists
            deactivate PickStore

            opt Shipment does not exist

                PickSvc->>+PickStore: NextShipmentCodeAsync()

                PickStore->>+DB: SELECT next Shipment code
                DB-->>PickStore: Shipment code
                deactivate DB

                PickStore-->>PickSvc: New ShipmentCode
                deactivate PickStore

                PickSvc->>+PickStore: AddShipment(shipment)

                PickStore-->>PickSvc: Shipment staged
                deactivate PickStore

            end

            %% ------------------------------------------
            %% 6. SAVE PICKING COMPLETION
            %% ------------------------------------------

            PickSvc->>+PickStore: SaveChangesAsync()

            PickStore->>+DB: UPDATE PickingList completion state
            Note right of DB: INSERT Shipment only when newly created

            DB-->>PickStore: Picking completion committed
            deactivate DB

            PickStore-->>PickSvc: Save result
            deactivate PickStore

        end

        PickSvc-->>PickAPI: Completion result or conflict
        deactivate PickSvc

        PickAPI-->>UI: Picking completion response
        deactivate PickAPI

        UI-->>Keeper: Display completion or exception status
        deactivate UI

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 2 - FLAG SHIPMENT EXCEPTION
    %% ==========================================

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)

        Note over Operator,DB: PART 2 - SHIPMENT EXCEPTION

        Operator->>+UI: Select Shipment and report exception

        UI->>+ShipAPI: FlagException(shipmentId, request)

        ShipAPI->>+ShipSvc: FlagExceptionAsync(shipmentId, data, actorRole)

        %% ------------------------------------------
        %% 7. VALIDATE OPERATOR
        %% ------------------------------------------

        ShipSvc->>+ShipSvc: EnsureOperator(actorRole)

        ShipSvc-->>ShipSvc: Authorization result
        deactivate ShipSvc

        alt Actor is not Operator

            Note right of ShipSvc: Return Forbidden

        else Actor is authorized

            %% ------------------------------------------
            %% 8. LOAD SHIPMENT
            %% ------------------------------------------

            ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: FindByIdAsync(shipmentId)

            ShipStore->>+DB: SELECT Shipment and Version
            DB-->>ShipStore: Shipment or null
            deactivate DB

            ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Shipment result
            deactivate ShipStore

            %% ------------------------------------------
            %% 9. VALIDATE EXCEPTION REQUEST
            %% ------------------------------------------

            alt Shipment missing, invalid state or stale Version

                Note right of ShipSvc: Return Not Found or Conflict

            else Exception request is valid

                Note right of ShipSvc: Set Shipment exception status

                Note right of ShipSvc: Record ExceptionReason

                %% ------------------------------------------
                %% 10. PERSIST EXCEPTION
                %% ------------------------------------------

                ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: SaveChangesAsync()

                ShipStore->>+DB: UPDATE Shipment status, reason and Version
                DB-->>ShipStore: Shipment exception saved
                deactivate DB

                ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Save successful
                deactivate ShipStore

                Note right of ShipSvc: Unissued portions must respect order readiness

            end

        end

        ShipSvc-->>ShipAPI: Shipment result or business error
        deactivate ShipSvc

        ShipAPI-->>UI: Exception response
        deactivate ShipAPI

        UI-->>Operator: Display Shipment exception
        deactivate UI

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 3 - RECORD ACTUAL RETAILER RECEIPT
    %% ==========================================

    rect rgb(242, 252, 245)

        Note over Retailer,DB: PART 3 - RETAILER ACTUAL RECEIPT CONFIRMATION

        Retailer->>+UI: Scan delivered QR and enter actual quantities

        Note right of UI: Enter received, missing and damaged quantities

        UI->>+ShipAPI: ConfirmReceipt(shipmentId, receiptRequest)

        ShipAPI->>+ShipSvc: ConfirmReceiptAsync(shipmentId, data, actorContext)

        %% ------------------------------------------
        %% 11. CHECK RECEIPT IDEMPOTENCY
        %% ------------------------------------------

        ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: FindByReceiptOperationKeyAsync(operationKey)

        ShipStore->>+DB: SELECT ReceiptConfirmation by OperationKey
        DB-->>ShipStore: Existing receipt or null
        deactivate DB

        ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Existing receipt result
        deactivate ShipStore

        alt Same operation key and same request already processed

            Note right of ShipSvc: Return the existing receipt result

            Note right of ShipSvc: Do not record another receipt

        else New receipt request or operation key conflict

            %% ------------------------------------------
            %% 12. LOAD SHIPMENT
            %% ------------------------------------------

            ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: FindByIdAsync(shipmentId)

            ShipStore->>+DB: SELECT Shipment and delivery status
            DB-->>ShipStore: Shipment or null
            deactivate DB

            ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Shipment context
            deactivate ShipStore

            %% ------------------------------------------
            %% 13. VALIDATE RETAILER ACCESS
            %% ------------------------------------------

            ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: CanViewOrderAsync(orderId, actorContext)

            ShipStore->>+DB: SELECT Retailer order access scope
            DB-->>ShipStore: Access result
            deactivate DB

            ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Authorized or Forbidden
            deactivate ShipStore

            %% ------------------------------------------
            %% 14. VALIDATE QR LABELS
            %% ------------------------------------------

            ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: ListLabelsAsync(shipmentId)

            ShipStore->>+DB: SELECT Shipment QR Labels and quantities
            DB-->>ShipStore: Expected QR Labels
            deactivate DB

            ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Shipment label details
            deactivate ShipStore

            %% ------------------------------------------
            %% 15. CHECK ACTUAL RECEIPT
            %% ------------------------------------------

            alt Unauthorized, invalid QR or inconsistent quantities

                Note right of ShipSvc: Reject receipt without side effects

            else Actual receipt data is valid

                %% ------------------------------------------
                %% 16. LOCK ORDER FOR RECEIPT UPDATE
                %% ------------------------------------------

                ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: FindOrderForUpdateAsync(orderId)

                ShipStore->>+DB: SELECT SalesOrder for transactional update
                DB-->>ShipStore: SalesOrder
                deactivate DB

                ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Order context
                deactivate ShipStore

                %% ------------------------------------------
                %% 17. STAGE RECEIPT CONFIRMATION
                %% ------------------------------------------

                ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: AddReceipt(receiptConfirmation)

                ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: ReceiptConfirmation staged
                deactivate ShipStore

                %% ------------------------------------------
                %% 18. RECORD ACTUAL RECEIPT ITEMS
                %% ------------------------------------------

                loop For each received Batch portion

                    ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: AddReceiptLine(receiptItem)

                    ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Actual quantities staged
                    deactivate ShipStore

                end

                %% ------------------------------------------
                %% 19. RECORD SCANNED QR LABELS
                %% ------------------------------------------

                loop For each confirmed QR Label

                    ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: AddReceiptQrLabel(receiptQrLabel)

                    ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Receipt QR reference staged
                    deactivate ShipStore

                    ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: AddLabelEvent(qrLabelEvent)

                    ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: QR Label event staged
                    deactivate ShipStore

                end

                %% ------------------------------------------
                %% 20. CHECK ALL WAREHOUSE RECEIPTS
                %% ------------------------------------------

                ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: ListByOrderAsync(orderId)

                ShipStore->>+DB: SELECT all Shipments and receipt states
                DB-->>ShipStore: Order shipment collection
                deactivate DB

                ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Shipment receipt summary
                deactivate ShipStore

                %% ------------------------------------------
                %% 21. UPDATE DELIVERY OUTCOME
                %% ------------------------------------------

                alt Receipt contains missing or damaged quantities

                    Note right of ShipSvc: Record actual quantities

                    Note right of ShipSvc: Mark affected Shipment as exception

                    Note right of ShipSvc: Do not mark order fully Delivered

                else Shipment fully received

                    Note right of ShipSvc: Mark Shipment as Received

                    opt All required Shipments are fully received

                        Note right of ShipSvc: Set SalesOrder status to Delivered

                    end

                end

                %% ------------------------------------------
                %% 22. RECORD STATUS HISTORY
                %% ------------------------------------------

                ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: AddOrderHistory(orderHistory)

                ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Order status history staged
                deactivate ShipStore

                %% ------------------------------------------
                %% 23. PERSIST ACTUAL RECEIPT
                %% ------------------------------------------

                ShipSvc->>+ShipStore: SaveChangesAsync()

                ShipStore->>+DB: INSERT ReceiptConfirmation and receipt items
                Note right of DB: INSERT scanned QR references and label events
                Note right of DB: UPDATE Shipment, Order and receipt statuses

                DB-->>ShipStore: Receipt transaction committed
                deactivate DB

                ShipStore-->>ShipSvc: Save successful
                deactivate ShipStore

                %% ------------------------------------------
                %% 24. EVALUATE ORDER COMPLETION
                %% ------------------------------------------

                opt Receipt changes order completion eligibility

                    ShipSvc->>+CompletionSvc: EvaluateAsync(orderId)

                    Note right of CompletionSvc: Check delivered, payment and complaint conditions

                    CompletionSvc-->>ShipSvc: Completion evaluation result
                    deactivate CompletionSvc

                end

            end

        end

        %% ------------------------------------------
        %% 25. RETURN RECEIPT RESULT
        %% ------------------------------------------

        ShipSvc-->>ShipAPI: Receipt result or business error
        deactivate ShipSvc

        ShipAPI-->>UI: Actual receipt response
        deactivate ShipAPI

        UI-->>Retailer: Display received quantities and Shipment status
        deactivate UI

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 4 - OPTIONAL COMPLAINT
    %% ==========================================

    opt Retailer files a separate complaint for missing or damaged goods

        Note over Retailer,DB: PART 4 - COMPLAINT RECORDING

        Retailer->>+UI: Submit discrepancy details and photo references

        UI->>+ComplaintAPI: Create(complaintRequest)

        ComplaintAPI->>+ComplaintSvc: CreateAsync(complaintData, actorContext)

        ComplaintSvc->>+ComplaintStore: CreateAsync(complaintData)

        ComplaintStore->>+DB: INSERT ReceiptDiscrepancy and affected items
        Note right of DB: Persist evidence references and batch price snapshots

        DB-->>ComplaintStore: Complaint persisted
        deactivate DB

        ComplaintStore-->>ComplaintSvc: Complaint result
        deactivate ComplaintStore

        ComplaintSvc-->>ComplaintAPI: Created complaint or error
        deactivate ComplaintSvc

        ComplaintAPI-->>UI: Complaint response
        deactivate ComplaintAPI

        UI-->>Retailer: Display complaint status
        deactivate UI

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over PickSvc,DB: Picking validation must not deduct Physical Stock

    Note over PickSvc,DB: Incomplete Picking cannot create a ready Shipment

    Note over ShipSvc,DB: Flagging an exception does not automatically cancel Reservations

    Note over ShipSvc,DB: Actual receipt records what the Retailer really received

    Note over ShipSvc,DB: Missing or damaged items do not restore dispatched stock automatically

    Note over ShipSvc,DB: Receipt confirmation must be idempotent

    Note over ComplaintSvc,DB: Complaint resolution and financial adjustments are separate workflows